---
import { getProxyUrl } from "../utils/image";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Street Rendering - Gabriele Radicello">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section
    class="relative h-[100svh] md:h-[100dvh] w-full overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center"
  >
    <!-- Interactive Point Cloud via iframe -->
    <iframe
      src={getProxyUrl("/progetti/street-rendering/embed.html")} data-src="/progetti/street-rendering/embed.html"
      class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full border-none z-0 pointer-events-none md:pointer-events-auto"
      allow="autoplay; fullscreen; vr"></iframe>

    <!-- Dark overlay for text readability, captures touch for scrolling on mobile -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40 z-10 pointer-events-auto md:pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="relative z-20 text-center px-6 pointer-events-auto md:pointer-events-none">
      <h1
        class="text-5xl md:text-8xl font-normal text-white tracking-tight"
        style="font-family: 'Helvetica Custom', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;"
      >
        Street Rendering
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-xl text-neutral-300 font-light max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Exploring the limits of digital perception.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content Section -->
  <section
    class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 md:py-32 text-neutral-300 text-lg leading-8 text-left"
  >
    <div class="mb-16 md:mb-24">
      <h2
        class="text-3xl font-normal text-neutral-50 mb-8"
        style="font-family: 'Helvetica Custom', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;"
      >
        Concept
      </h2>
      <div class="grid gap-12">
        <p>
          Street Rendering investigates the limits of machine perception by
          transforming Google Street View images into an imperfect 3D model
          using Gaussian Splatting. Through a virtual "street photography"
          conducted from impossible perspectives, the project elevates
          distortions and reconstruction errors to an artistic language,
          reflecting on technology's inability to faithfully replicate reality.
        </p>

        <img
          src={getProxyUrl("/progetti/street-rendering/sr1.png")} data-src="/progetti/street-rendering/sr1.png"
          alt="Modello 3D generato tramite Gaussian Splatting della piazza della scuola d'arte, con evidenti frammentazioni"
          class="w-full h-auto bg-neutral-900 gallery-img rounded-sm shadow-md"
          loading="lazy"
        />

        <p>
          360° images of the square in front of the Academy were downloaded
          from Google Street View and transformed into a 3D model using the
          Gaussian Splatting technique. The result is a fragmented space where
          the reconstruction oscillates between sharp details and severe
          distortions, reflecting the quality and coherence of the available
          data.
        </p>

        <img
          src={getProxyUrl("/progetti/street-rendering/sr2.png")} data-src="/progetti/street-rendering/sr2.png"
          alt="Visualizzazione dei dati tridimensionali ricavati da Google Street View, oscillante tra dettagli ed errori digitali"
          class="w-full h-auto bg-neutral-900 gallery-img rounded-sm shadow-md"
          loading="lazy"
        />

        <p>
          Within this reconstructed world, a series of street photography
          shots were produced, choosing subjects that highlight the contrast
          between what is faithfully rendered and what dissolves into error.
          The virtual camera was positioned at viewpoints impossible to obtain
          with Street View, expanding the possibilities of observation while
          simultaneously exaggerating the imperfections of the technology.
        </p>

        <img
          src={getProxyUrl("/progetti/street-rendering/sr3.png")} data-src="/progetti/street-rendering/sr3.png"
          alt="Inquadratura virtuale da una prospettiva aerea impossibile, evidenziando il dissolvimento della geometria stradale"
          class="w-full h-auto bg-neutral-900 gallery-img rounded-sm shadow-md"
          loading="lazy"
        />

        <p>
          The work becomes a reflection on the way machines perceive and
          reconstruct the world, exposing their limits rather than their
          capabilities.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Gallery Section -->
    <div class="border-t border-neutral-800 pt-16">
      <h2
        class="text-3xl font-normal text-neutral-50 mb-12"
        style="font-family: 'Helvetica Custom', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;"
      >
        Gallery
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <img
          src={getProxyUrl("/progetti/street-rendering/(1).PNG")} data-src="/progetti/street-rendering/(1).PNG"
          alt="Fotografia virtuale di un lampione deformato e frammentato che svanisce nel vuoto digitale"
          class="w-full h-auto object-cover aspect-[4/3] bg-neutral-900 gallery-img"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <img
          src={getProxyUrl("/progetti/street-rendering/(2).PNG")} data-src="/progetti/street-rendering/(2).PNG"
          alt="Dettaglio ravvicinato della facciata del palazzo storico dell'Accademia, ricostruita con texture di nuvole di punti"
          class="w-full h-auto object-cover aspect-[4/3] bg-neutral-900 gallery-img"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <img
          src={getProxyUrl("/progetti/street-rendering/(3).PNG")} data-src="/progetti/street-rendering/(3).PNG"
          alt="Inquadratura stradale angolata che mostra la distorsione geometrica delle auto in transito riprese da Street View"
          class="w-full h-auto object-cover aspect-[4/3] bg-neutral-900 gallery-img"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <img
          src={getProxyUrl("/progetti/street-rendering/(4).PNG")} data-src="/progetti/street-rendering/(4).PNG"
          alt="Prospettiva rasoterra di un marciapiede i cui dettagli fisici si scompongono in macchie di colore sbiadite"
          class="w-full h-auto object-cover aspect-[4/3] bg-neutral-900 gallery-img"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <img
          src={getProxyUrl("/progetti/street-rendering/(5).PNG")} data-src="/progetti/street-rendering/(5).PNG"
          alt="Vista astratta dell'ambiente urbano in cui le sagome delle persone si dissolvono in forme fluide e incorporee"
          class="w-full h-auto object-cover aspect-[4/3] bg-neutral-900 gallery-img"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <img
          src={getProxyUrl("/progetti/street-rendering/(6).PNG")} data-src="/progetti/street-rendering/(6).PNG"
          alt="Inquadratura di un albero e di una panchina della piazza, con le foglie e la struttura resi come punti fluttuanti"
          class="w-full h-auto object-cover aspect-[4/3] bg-neutral-900 gallery-img"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <img
          src={getProxyUrl("/progetti/street-rendering/(7).PNG")} data-src="/progetti/street-rendering/(7).PNG"
          alt="Prospettiva dall'interno di una distorsione tridimensionale, che crea un effetto di architettura liquida"
          class="w-full h-auto object-cover aspect-[4/3] bg-neutral-900 gallery-img"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <img
          src={getProxyUrl("/progetti/street-rendering/(8).PNG")} data-src="/progetti/street-rendering/(8).PNG"
          alt="Particolare del selciato della piazza e delle ombre, ricostruiti con imperfezioni tipiche degli algoritmi di splatting"
          class="w-full h-auto object-cover aspect-[4/3] bg-neutral-900 gallery-img"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <img
          src={getProxyUrl("/progetti/street-rendering/(9).PNG")} data-src="/progetti/street-rendering/(9).PNG"
          alt="Fotografia virtuale dall'alto di un vicolo adiacente alla piazza, con geometrie spezzate e texture mancanti"
          class="w-full h-auto object-cover aspect-[4/3] bg-neutral-900 gallery-img"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <img
          src={getProxyUrl("/progetti/street-rendering/(10).PNG")} data-src="/progetti/street-rendering/(10).PNG"
          alt="Veduta prospettica in cui la luce del sole virtuale si riflette su superfici sconnesse e frammenti poligonali"
          class="w-full h-auto object-cover aspect-[4/3] bg-neutral-900 gallery-img"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <img
          src={getProxyUrl("/progetti/street-rendering/(11).PNG")} data-src="/progetti/street-rendering/(11).PNG"
          alt="Dettaglio di un cartello stradale e di una recinzione, deformati dall'approssimazione del modello 3D"
          class="w-full h-auto object-cover aspect-[4/3] bg-neutral-900 gallery-img"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <img
          src={getProxyUrl("/progetti/street-rendering/(12).PNG")} data-src="/progetti/street-rendering/(12).PNG"
          alt="Panoramica della piazza dell'Accademia ricostruita, che mostra l'intera estensione del modello generato"
          class="w-full h-auto object-cover aspect-[4/3] bg-neutral-900 gallery-img"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
